        "en": "Caring family veterinarians with walk-in access"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients speak warmly of the family-run clinic, praising Dr. Leslie and the clinical staff for their caring, practical approach to pet health. Most pet owners describe long-standing trust spanning decades, though two reviewers reported negative experiences during emergency visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "positive",
