      "title": {
        "en": "Budget-friendly fees for routine care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently highlight the hospital for offering some of the most affordable veterinary rates in Chicago. Reviewers appreciate that routine checkups, vaccinations, and dental procedures are priced reasonably without unnecessary testing or hidden fees."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 5,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for household pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize that veterinarians and assistants handle both dogs and cats with patience and genuine care. Multiple pet parents note that clinicians keep nervous animals calm during physical examinations, blood work, vaccinations, and grooming procedures."
      }
    }
  ],
